
---

## 🚀 Push to GitHub (Step-by-Step)

Open your terminal in the project folder and run:

```bash
# 1. Initialize git
git init

# 2. Add all files
git add .

# 3. Commit
git commit -m "feat: birds with sounds - realtime UI + Docker + Nginx"

# 4. Create repo on GitHub first (via web), then:
git branch -M main
git remote add origin https://github.com/<YOUR_USERNAME>/birds-sounds-app.git
git push -u origin main
